1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:02,840
提神咖啡馆

2
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,600
提道神

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,540
养豆

4
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:09,300
徐永强牧师

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:12,760
烘焙过后的咖啡豆

6
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,660
需经过大约14天

7
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,620
放在袋子的养豆期

8
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,900
这个时间段

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:23,720
豆子会释放二氧化碳

10
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:26,480
使袋中的压力增加

11
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,800
咖啡的分方物质

12
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,880
与油脂会得到完美的结合

13
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:36,020
咖啡豆一过了养豆期

14
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:39,540
就应该被新鲜使用

15
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:42,900
照理基督徒信主后

16
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:46,980
也需要一段时间的养豆期

17
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:51,100
在好好接受基本教导之后

18
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:54,080
就应该待命出发

19
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,080
为主发光了

20
00:00:56,080 --> 00:01:01,580
然而今天多少基督徒信主多年

21
00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:04,900
还是处在被养的状态

22
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:09,000
完全不想自己被使用

23
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:14,720
也许就这么一个不想被用的念头

24
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:17,400
或三几个借口

25
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:36,636
最美的使用时间段就溜走了Rusting of Coffee Beans The roasted coffee beans need to go through a resting period of about 14 days in the bag.

26
00:01:37,796 --> 00:01:42,276
During this time, the beans will release carbon dioxide,

27
00:01:43,096 --> 00:01:46,056
which will increase the pressure in the bag,

28
00:01:46,056 --> 00:01:52,216
and the aroma and oil of the coffee will be perfectly blended.

29
00:01:53,476 --> 00:01:57,316
Once the coffee beans have passed the resting period,

30
00:01:57,936 --> 00:02:00,016
they should be used afresh.

31
00:02:01,796 --> 00:02:06,756
Theoretically, new believers should take a period of resting.

32
00:02:07,796 --> 00:02:11,156
After receiving the basic solid training,

33
00:02:11,156 --> 00:02:16,376
we should get ready and set off to shine for the Lord

34
00:02:16,376 --> 00:02:20,856
how many Christians today

35
00:02:20,856 --> 00:02:24,756
have believed in the Lord for many years

36
00:02:24,756 --> 00:02:27,716
but are still resting

37
00:02:27,716 --> 00:02:31,476
and don't want to be used at all

38
00:02:31,476 --> 00:02:34,536
maybe it's just a thought

39
00:02:34,536 --> 00:02:36,776
I don't want to be used

40
00:02:36,776 --> 00:02:40,396
or a few excuses

41
00:02:40,396 --> 00:02:48,076
but the most beautiful time of serving has slipped away
